C3-OPD final Search-QA source release

This repository distributes method-specific experimental source over the SDAR
and verl frameworks. Original copyright and license notices in framework files
are retained. SDAR is developed by ZJU-REAL; verl contains contributions from
ByteDance and the wider open-source community. See LICENSE and the notices in
individual source files.

Changes for this release include C3 credit fusion, action-only verification,
Teacher-only GRPO+OPSD ablation, four-replica execution and evaluation-residency
support, thinking-isolated action parsing, fixed-probe evaluation, and portable
deployment paths. Portability edits do not change the reported advantage
equations or the final experiment's numerical settings.

Datasets, model weights, checkpoints, raw traces, logs, and per-question results
are not distributed with this repository.
